  "description": "After finally finding happiness in a new family, he is determined to protect the home he has built. But when his husband suddenly dies, his stepson reveals the forbidden desire he has secretly harbored for years and the shocking truth behind that fateful night. Torn between guilt, grief, and feelings that should never exist, he faces a dangerous confession: “I love you. Can I be your husband now?”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/_nabbeun)",
